# Firoz Mahmud Portfolio — Cursor AI Context

**Before any edit, read `/AGENTS.md` in the repo root** for complete architecture, design system, content rules, and session decisions.

## Non-negotiables

1. **Content source**: `src/data/content.ts` — never invent resume facts
2. **Display role**: Senior Software Engineer (Forward Deployed AI only in `availability` text)
3. **Font**: Inter only
4. **Layout**: use `.page-container` — no nested `px-*` + `max-w-*` stacking
5. **Buttons**: use `src/components/ui/Button.tsx` — glass CSS in `index.css`; nav/tabs use `glassLayers={false}` + `GlassSelectIndicator`
6. **Nav scroll-spy**: use `src/hooks/useActiveSection.ts` — not IntersectionObserver
7. **Mobile header**: below `lg` (1023px) — photo stays visible; hamburger opens slide-down nav + theme; hamburger **unmounted** at `lg+` (conditional render, not `lg:hidden` on `Button`)
8. **Theme**: `localStorage` key `portfolio-theme`; light `#e9eef5`, dark `#2e2e36`; system preference on first visit
9. **Reduced motion**: use `useReducedMotion()` for animations; `GalaxyBackground` returns null
10. **Lenis**: smooth scroll via `window.__lenis`; BackToTop uses it for scroll-to-top; mobile menu calls `stop()` / `start()`
11. **Cosmic visuals**: lazy `GalaxyBackground` (page-level WebGL) + `HeroScene` (hero CSS overlays); sections get sparse stars via `CosmicAtmosphere` minimal — no nebula blobs per section
12. **Footer placement**: outside galaxy wrapper in `HomePage.tsx` — stays above canvas
13. **Commits**: only when user explicitly requests
14. **Production build**: run `npm run build` after code changes so `dist/` stays updated (or keep `npm run build:watch` running)
15. **Section titles**: Title Case for headings; subtitles stay sentence case
16. **AI context**: after structural/UX/command changes, update `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md`, and this file

## Live page order

Hero → About → Skills → Experience → Projects → Certifications → Education → Contact → Footer

Nav (`navLinks`): About · Skills · Experience · Projects · Certifications · Education · Contact

